      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"GeoPage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>GeoPage</code></a> from the given <a href=\"GeoResults.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>GeoResults</code></a>, <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> and total.",
