    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> to request the next <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>. Can be <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a> in case the\ncurrent <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> is already the last one. Clients should check <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html#hasNext()\"><code>Slice.hasNext()</code></a> before calling this method.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>，用于请求下一个<a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>。如果当前的<a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>已经是最后一个，则可以返回<a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>。客户端在调用此方法之前应检查<a href=\"../domain/Slice.html#hasNext()\"><code>Slice.hasNext()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Returns the <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a> to request the previous <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>. Can be <a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a> in case the\ncurrent <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> is already the first one. Clients should check <a href=\"../domain/Slice.html#hasPrevious()\"><code>Slice.hasPrevious()</code></a> before calling this\nmethod.",
      "translation": "返回一个<a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Pageable</code></a>，用于请求前一个<a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>。如果当前的<a href=\"../domain/Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>已经是第一个，则返回<a href=\"../domain/Pageable.html#unpaged()\"><code>Pageable.unpaged()</code></a>。客户端在调用此方法之前应检查<a href=\"../domain/Slice.html#hasPrevious()\"><code>Slice.hasPrevious()</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Custom <a href=\"../domain/Page.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Page</code></a> to carry the average distance retrieved from the <a href=\"GeoResults.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>GeoResults</code></a> the <a href=\"GeoPage.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.geo\"><code>GeoPage</code></a> is set up\nfrom.",
